From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:46:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(tui): preserve held continuation outcome during reap
 [daveey]

Skip automatic close refresh while refused/update-pause/carried markers retain recovery custody. Their writer remains the live backend after teardown, so an unqualified refresh incorrectly changes interrupted to running.

Proof: four new tests fail against the prior implementation (including real refused prompt, reap and delayed retry); 166 tests pass across outcome, refused-retry and split-module suites. Original failed-turn/good-reply regression now asserts stored done through actual teardown for each automatic close reason. Removed unreachable active-holder fallback. scripts/check passes.
---
